#: warehouse/templates/manage/account/totp-provision.html:21
#, python-format
msgid ""
"Visit <a href=\"%(href)s\">PyPI's help page</a> for a list of compatible "
"applications."
msgstr ""
"En lista över kompatibla appar finns på <a href=\"%(href)s\">PyPI:s "
"hjälpsida</a>."

#: warehouse/templates/manage/account/totp-provision.html:29
msgid ""
"For security reasons, you can only associate one authentication application "
"per PyPI account."
msgstr ""
"Av säkerhetsskäl kan du bara koppla en autentiseringsapp till varje PyPI-"
"konto."

#: warehouse/templates/manage/account/totp-provision.html:40
msgid ""
"<strong>No QR scanner?</strong> Enter this code in your TOTP application "
"instead:"
msgstr ""
"<strong>Ingen QR-skanner?</strong> Ange i stället denna kod i TOTP-appen:"

#: warehouse/templates/manage/account/totp-provision.html:74
msgid ""
"To finalize the set-up process, enter the 6-digit code provided by your TOTP"
" application."
msgstr ""
"Slutför konfigureringen genom att ange den 6-siffriga kod som TOTP-appen "
"visar."

#: warehouse/templates/manage/account/webauthn-provision.html:10
#, python-format
msgid ""
"PyPI supports any device that adheres to the <a href=\"%(href)s\" "
"title=\"%(title)s\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">FIDO standard</a>."
msgstr ""
"PyPI har stöd för alla enheter som följer <a href=\"%(href)s\" "
"title=\"%(title)s\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">FIDO-standarden</a>."

#: warehouse/templates/manage/account/webauthn-provision.html:12
#, python-format
msgid ""
"Popular <em>USB keys</em> include <a href=\"%(yubico_href)s\" "
"title=\"%(title)s\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">Yubikey</a>, <a "
"href=\"%(titan_href)s\" title=\"%(title)s\" target=\"_blank\" "
"rel=\"noopener\">Google Titan</a> and <a href=\"%(thetis_href)s\" "
"title=\"%(title)s\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">Thetis</a>."
msgstr ""
"Vanliga <em>USB-nycklar</em> är <a href=\"%(yubico_href)s\" "
"title=\"%(title)s\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">Yubikey</a>, <a "
"href=\"%(titan_href)s\" title=\"%(title)s\" target=\"_blank\" "
"rel=\"noopener\">Google Titan</a> och <a href=\"%(thetis_href)s\" "
"title=\"%(title)s\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">Thetis</a>."

#: warehouse/templates/manage/account/webauthn-provision.html:47
msgid ""
"Please give this device a name. 64 characters or fewer. All Unicode is "
"valid, including spaces."
msgstr ""
"Ge enheten ett namn med högst 64 tecken. Alla Unicode-tecken är giltiga, "
"även blanksteg."

#: warehouse/templates/manage/account/webauthn-provision.html:68
#, python-format
msgid ""
"<strong>Not working?</strong> Check you're using a device that follows the "
"<a href=\"%(fido_href)s\" title=\"%(title)s\" target=\"_blank\" "
"rel=\"noopener\">FIDO specification</a> and a <a href=\"%(mozilla_href)s\" "
"title=\"%(title)s\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">compatible "
"browser</a>."
msgstr ""
"<strong>Fungerar det inte?</strong> Kontrollera att du använder en enhet som"
" följer <a href=\"%(fido_href)s\" title=\"%(title)s\" target=\"_blank\" "
"rel=\"noopener\">FIDO-specifikationen</a> och en <a "
"href=\"%(mozilla_href)s\" title=\"%(title)s\" target=\"_blank\" "
"rel=\"noopener\">kompatibel webbläsare</a>."

#: warehouse/templates/manage/account/webauthn-provision.html:79
msgid ""
"Note that some older USB keys do not adhere to the FIDO standard and will "
"not work with PyPI."
msgstr ""
"Observera att vissa äldre USB-nycklar inte följer FIDO-standarden och inte "
"fungerar med PyPI."

#: warehouse/templates/manage/organization/activate_subscription.html:12
msgid ""
"Company accounts require an active subscription. Please enter up-to-date "
"billing information to enable the account."
msgstr ""
"Företagskonton kräver en aktiv prenumeration. Ange aktuella "
"faktureringsuppgifter för att aktivera kontot."

#: warehouse/templates/manage/organization/activate_subscription.html:28
#, python-format
msgid ""
"I agree to the PyPI <a href=\"%(tos_url)s\">Terms of Service</a> on behalf "
"of the %(organization_name)s organization."
msgstr ""
"Jag godkänner PyPI:s <a href=\"%(tos_url)s\">användarvillkor</a> på "
"organisationen %(organization_name)s vägnar."

#: warehouse/templates/manage/organization/history.html:11
msgid ""
"Each time you (or your collaborators) perform a security action related to "
"this organization, the action is recorded and displayed here."
msgstr ""
"Varje gång du eller dina medarbetare utför en säkerhetsåtgärd som rör denna "
"organisation registreras åtgärden och visas här."

#: warehouse/templates/manage/organization/history.html:24
#, python-format
msgid ""
"%(previous_organization_name)s organization renamed to %(organization_name)s"
msgstr ""
"Organisationen %(previous_organization_name)s har bytt namn till "
"%(organization_name)s"

#: warehouse/templates/manage/organization/history.html:39
#, python-format
msgid ""
"<a href=\"%(href)s\">%(project_name)s</a> project removed from organization"
msgstr ""
"Projektet <a href=\"%(href)s\">%(project_name)s</a> har tagits bort från "
"organisationen"

#: warehouse/templates/manage/organization/history.html:45
#, python-format
msgid "<a href=\"%(href)s\">%(username)s</a> added as organization %(role_name)s"
msgstr ""
"<a href=\"%(href)s\">%(username)s</a> har lagts till som %(role_name)s i "
"organisationen"

#: warehouse/templates/manage/organization/history.html:51
#, python-format
msgid ""
"<a href=\"%(href)s\">%(username)s</a> removed as organization %(role_name)s"
msgstr ""
"<a href=\"%(href)s\">%(username)s</a> har tagits bort som %(role_name)s i "
"organisationen"

#: warehouse/templates/manage/organization/history.html:59
#, python-format
msgid ""
"<a href=\"%(href)s\">%(username)s</a> changed to organization %(role_name)s"
msgstr ""
"<a href=\"%(href)s\">%(username)s</a> har ändrats till %(role_name)s i "
"organisationen"

#: warehouse/templates/manage/organization/history.html:64
#, python-format
msgid ""
"<a href=\"%(href)s\">%(username)s</a> invited to join as organization "
"%(role_name)s"
msgstr ""
"<a href=\"%(href)s\">%(username)s</a> har bjudits in som %(role_name)s i "
"organisationen"

#: warehouse/templates/manage/organization/history.html:69
#, python-format
msgid ""
"<a href=\"%(href)s\">%(username)s</a> declined invitation to join as "
"organization %(role_name)s"
msgstr ""
"<a href=\"%(href)s\">%(username)s</a> har avböjt inbjudan som %(role_name)s "
"i organisationen"

#: warehouse/templates/manage/organization/history.html:74
#, python-format
msgid ""
"Revoked invitation for <a href=\"%(href)s\">%(username)s</a> to join as "
"organization %(role_name)s"
msgstr ""
"Återkallade inbjudan för <a href=\"%(href)s\">%(username)s</a> att ansluta "
"som %(role_name)s i organisationen"
